      "body": "<table><tr><th>Sıfat</th><th>Okunuş</th><th>Zıttı</th><th>Okunuş</th></tr><tr><td>beautiful (güzel)</td><td>«[byuu]-ti-fıl»</td><td>ugly (çirkin)</td><td>«[a]-gli»</td></tr><tr><td>fat (şişman)</td><td>«f{a}t»</td><td>thin (zayıf)</td><td>«{t}in»</td></tr><tr><td>tall (uzun boylu)</td><td>«tool»</td><td>short (kısa boylu)</td><td>«şoot»</td></tr><tr><td>young (genç)</td><td>«yang»</td><td>old (yaşlı)</td><td>«ould»</td></tr><tr><td>strong (güçlü)</td><td>«strong»</td><td>weak (güçsüz)</td><td>«{w}iik»</td></tr><tr><td>rich (zengin)</td><td>«riç»</td><td>poor (fakir)</td><td>«poo»</td></tr></table>"
